{"track":"python","category":"함수 만들기 ② 조건·반복·리스트","level":2,"title":"짝수 개수","desc":"<p>정수 리스트에서 <b>짝수의 개수</b>를 돌려주는 함수 <code>count_even(nums)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def count_even(nums):\n    pass\n","solution":"def count_even(nums):\n    n = 0\n    for x in nums:\n        if x % 2 == 0:\n            n += 1\n    return n\n","hint":"<p>짝수 조건은 <code>x % 2 == 0</code>.</p>","tests":[{"call":"count_even([1, 2, 3, 4])","expected":2,"visible":true},{"call":"count_even([])","expected":0,"visible":true},{"call":"count_even([1, 3])","expected":0,"visible":false},{"call":"count_even([0, -2, 7])","expected":2,"visible":false}],"id":"py-290"}